📅 Leap Year Checker

A beginner-friendly Python program that checks whether a given year is a leap year based on the standard leap-year rules.
The program also allows the user to check multiple years and quit by entering q.


📌 Features
📅 Accepts a year from the user
✅ Checks whether the year is a leap year
❌ Identifies years that are not leap years
🧮 Uses divisibility rules with %
